      "title": "What an Embedding Is",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "What an Embedding Is",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Embedding = Meaning as Geometry",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Embedding== = fixed-length **float vector** made by a model",
                "Similar inputs land {green:close together} in space",
                "Similarity signal = ==distance or angle== between vectors",
                "No single dimension means anything on its own"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Same Model, Same Pipeline",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Compare vectors only from the ==same model and version==",
                "Mixed models give {red:meaningless scores}",
                "One pipeline embeds docs at **index time** and queries at **search time**",
                "If the model requires it, add prefixes: `query:` vs `passage:`"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Core Workflow",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Chunk",
                    "sub": "split text",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Embed",
                    "sub": "each chunk",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Store",
                    "sub": "vector + metadata",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Embed query",
                    "sub": "same model",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Top-k",
                    "sub": "nearest vectors",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "One model end to end",
              "text": "Docs and queries must share the ==same model, version== and prefix rules, or scores mean nothing."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Distance Metrics and Normalisation",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Distance Metrics and Normalisation",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Three Metrics",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Metric",
                "Formula",
                "Better =",
                "Magnitude"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "==Cosine==",
                  "`dot(a,b)/(|a||b|)`",
                  "higher (-1 to 1)",
                  "{green:ignored}"
                ],
                [
                  "==Dot product==",
                  "`sum(a_i*b_i)`",
                  "higher",
                  "{red:rewarded}"
                ],
                [
                  "==Euclidean (L2)==",
                  "`sqrt(sum((a_i-b_i)^2))`",
                  "lower",
                  "{red:sensitive}"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Cosine measures ==angle only==",
                "Dot product rewards angle **and** length: longer vectors score higher",
                "L2 is straight-line distance"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Normalise to Unit Length",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "v / |v|",
                    "sub": "unit length",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "cosine == dot",
                    "sub": "|a|=|b|=1",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "L2^2 = 2 - 2*cos",
                    "sub": "monotone",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Same ranking",
                    "sub": "all three",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "import numpy as np",
                "v = v / np.linalg.norm(v)"
              ],
              "note": "normalise docs and queries the same way"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Which Metric?",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Match the metric to how the model was trained: ==check the model card==",
                "Most text embedding models are trained for **cosine**",
                "So: normalise, then use ==dot== for speed"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Unnormalised vectors make dot and L2 rank differently from cosine. Normalise, and set the index metric to match."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Choosing an Embedding Model and Dimensions",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Choosing an Embedding Model and Dimensions",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Selection Criteria",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Recall on your own domain data==, not just MTEB rank",
                "Max input tokens and language coverage",
                "Latency, cost, licence"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Dimensions",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "More dims (1536, 3072): more capacity, slower search",
                "Memory = ==N * dims * 4 bytes== (float32)",
                "==Matryoshka== models: truncate 3072 to 256, small loss",
                "{red:Re-normalise} after truncating"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "v = v[:256]",
                "v = v / np.linalg.norm(v)"
              ],
              "note": "truncate, then re-normalise"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Quantisation and Migration",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Type",
                "Size vs float32"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "float16",
                  "1/2"
                ],
                [
                  "int8",
                  "1/4"
                ],
                [
                  "binary",
                  "1/32"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Usually ==rescore== top hits on full vectors"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Version index",
                    "sub": "v2",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dual-write",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Re-embed corpus",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Switch reads",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Model change",
              "text": "New model or dimension means ==re-embed everything==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Vector Indexes: Flat, HNSW and IVF",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Vector Indexes: Flat, HNSW and IVF",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Flat: Brute Force",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Compares the query to ==every vector==: O(N) per query",
                "{green:Exact}, 100% recall; fine up to ~==100k== vectors"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. HNSW: Layered Graph",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Top layer",
                    "sub": "sparse, enter here",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Greedy hops",
                    "sub": "move closer",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Descend",
                    "sub": "layer by layer",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Bottom layer",
                    "sub": "dense, final",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Fast and ==high recall==, but ==high memory=="
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Knob",
                "Meaning",
                "Trade-off"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`M`",
                  "links per node",
                  "more recall, more RAM"
                ],
                [
                  "`efConstruction`",
                  "build quality",
                  "slower build"
                ],
                [
                  "`efSearch`",
                  "candidates at query",
                  "more recall, more latency"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. IVF and IVF-PQ",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==k-means== splits vectors into `nlist` cells; needs a {purple:training step}",
                "Query probes only the `nprobe` nearest centroids",
                "Uses less memory than HNSW",
                "==IVF-PQ==: product quantisation compresses vectors for huge corpora, some recall loss"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "q = faiss.IndexFlatL2(d)",
                "index = faiss.IndexIVFFlat(q, d, nlist)",
                "index.train(xb)",
                "index.add(xb)",
                "index.nprobe = 8",
                "D, I = index.search(xq, 10)"
              ],
              "note": "train before add; nprobe is set at query time"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "nprobe=1",
              "text": "Fast, but **misses neighbours** sitting near a cell border. Raise `nprobe` for recall."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ANN Recall Trade-offs and Metadata Filtering",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "ANN Recall Trade-offs and Metadata Filtering",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Recall@k",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "ANN trades ==exactness for speed==",
                "**recall@k** = share of the true top-k (from flat search) the index returns",
                "Measure: run exact search on sampled queries, then compare",
                "Raise `efSearch` or `nprobe` until recall hits ~95% at acceptable p95"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Metadata Filtering",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Post-filter",
                "Pre-filter / filtered HNSW"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "When",
                  "After top-k search",
                  "During traversal"
                ],
                [
                  "Count",
                  "{red:Fewer than k, or zero}",
                  "{green:Correct}"
                ],
                [
                  "Risk",
                  "Selective filter empties results",
                  "Slow search, fragmented graph"
                ],
                [
                  "Fix",
                  "Overfetch a larger k",
                  "==Brute force== on the small filtered set"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "No recall measurement",
                "Filtering after a small top-k",
                "Mixing metrics between index and query",
                "Forgetting to normalise",
                "Re-embedding with a new model without rebuilding"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Report ==recall@k== with p95 latency. Selective filter: pre-filter or brute force."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Embeddings and Vector Search Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Embeddings and Vector Search Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Similarity and Memory",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Metric",
                "Measures",
                "Better"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Cosine",
                  "angle",
                  "higher"
                ],
                [
                  "Dot",
                  "angle × magnitude",
                  "higher"
                ],
                [
                  "L2",
                  "distance",
                  "lower"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Unit vectors: ==cosine == dot==, all three rank identically",
                "Memory = ==N × dims × 4 bytes== (float32)",
                "1M × 1536 ≈ ==6 GB== before index overhead"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Index Choice and Dials",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Index",
                "Pick when",
                "Dial"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Flat",
                  "under ~100k, exact",
                  "none"
                ],
                [
                  "HNSW",
                  "low latency, high recall, enough RAM",
                  "`efSearch`"
                ],
                [
                  "IVF(-PQ)",
                  "huge or memory-bound corpus",
                  "`nprobe`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Dial up = {green:recall up}, {red:latency up}",
                "Always report ==recall@k== and **p95**"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Checklist",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Same model for docs and queries",
                "Normalise if cosine",
                "Index metric matches the model",
                "Filtering: overfetch or pre-filter",
                "Model change: ==re-embed everything=="
              ],
              "style": "checkbox",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Post-filter trap",
              "text": "Filtering a small top-k can return **fewer than k** results."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
